      ],
      "content": "In the following item:- SAINT JOHN'S ROAD 1. 5252                                               (North Side)                                                    Heath Cottage TL 05O6 2/232 II                                   GV 2. C16 or C17, much altered.  Front wall of flint rubble with red brick dressings and flush quoins.  Side elevation timber framed with whitewashed brick nogging.  Old tiled roof with gable end to road.  2 storeys, flush casement windows.  1 storey wing on right. Included for group value. Heath Cottage shall be amended to read Heath Barn Cottage. ------------------------------------ SAINT JOHN'S ROAD 1. 5252                                                    (North Side)                                                    Heath Cottage TL 0506 2/232 II                       GV 2.                        C16 or C17, much altered.  Front wall of flint rubble with red brick dressings and flush quoins.  Side elevation timber framed with whitewashed brick nogging. Old tiled roof with gable end to road.  2 storeys, flush casement windows. 1 storey wing on right.  Included for group value. Heath Farmhouse, Heath Cottage and Heath Barn form a group. Listing NGR: TL0503506279"
    }
